'''Murra''' was a [[Gender|female]] [[tauntaun]]. She was one<ref name="FACPOV" /> of several tauntauns utilized by the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] on the [[planet]] [[Hoth]].<ref name="ESB" /> Murra was used as a mount by [[Han Solo]] in his search for [[Luke Skywalker]] just before the [[Battle of Hoth]]. She was the mother of [[Riba]], who had been taken out as Skywalker's mount; Murra hoped to reach her daughter and keep her warm.<ref name="FACPOV" /> Unknown to her, Riba had been [[Death|killed]] by a [[Unidentified wampa|wampa]], which had then taken away Skywalker.<ref name="ESB" /> Murra died of exposure<ref name="Hasbro">{{HasbroCite|set=Star Wars: The Black Series|subset=Archive|pack=Han Solo (Hoth)|link=collections/star-wars/products/star-wars-the-black-series-archive-han-solo-hoth}}</ref> to the cold, leading Solo to cut open her corpse to keep Skywalker warm.<ref name="ESB" />

